// A lean log file stays on the live path and inside the log cap.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE log  ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG log law

IMPULSE log 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "log" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
